            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all 36 manifest paths from a risk lens.",
              "The functional change widens contract injection scope: frontmatter lists gain shaper/builder, and PHASE_NAMES in engine/pipkg/labdrian-gate.ts gains shaper and builder. The injected content is a bare contract path line read from package-contained contract files, and the gate keeps its existing containment and silent-skip handling. No new input handling, privilege, secret, or network surface is introduced.",
