              "Reviewed all 36 manifest paths. The change moves the oo-quality and anti-generic-design scope from the deleted sdd-* agents to the shaper and builder roles. The frontmatter, both asset copies, the goldens, the specs, the README, the changelog and the Pi gate were updated consistently, with no stale duplicate left in the visible patch.",
